Corresponding Source
--------------------

The complete corresponding source for this binary distribution is available at:

  https://github.com/tubedigga/mp-stretch

While this Sample Knob FX work is in review, use branch
`cursor/mp-stretch-knob-fx-01d5` (pull request #1):

  https://github.com/tubedigga/mp-stretch/pull/1
  https://github.com/tubedigga/mp-stretch/tree/cursor/mp-stretch-knob-fx-01d5

After merge, use the default branch (`main`) of the same repository.

Rebuild from a checkout with:

  git submodule update --init --recursive
  ./scripts/build.sh
  ./scripts/package.sh

